"zh\",\"languageName\":\"简体中文\",\"locale\":\"zh_CN\",\"paths\":{\"prefix\":\"\u002Fzh\"},\"title\":\"Poki (宝玩)\"},\"slug\":\"marina-club-rush\"})":{"status":"fulfilled","endpointName":"getGame","requestId":"yEQjwgZ7MtJIvfCqej-LK","originalArgs":{"slug":"marina-club-rush","site":{"id":73,"lang":"zh","title":"Poki (宝玩)","languageName":"简体中文","domain":"poki.com","domain_title":"Poki.com","iso_lang":"zh","locale":"zh_CN","paths":{"prefix":"\u002Fzh"}},"device":"desktop","geo":"CN","experiment":"b-bc1ecceb","pageType":"game","path":"\u002Fzh\u002Fg\u002Fmarina-club-rush"},"startedTimeStamp":1781578136505,"data":{"id":32172,"developer":"Xscape","developers":["Xscape"],"fullscreen":false,"allow_smart_refresh":true,"desktop_available":true,"mobile_available":true,"slug":"marina-club-rush","title":"Marina Club Rush","english_title":"Marina Club Rush","description":"\u003Cp\u003E\n《Marina Club Rush》是一款码头经营模拟游戏，您将在这里建造并发展一家时尚的海滨俱乐部！从捕捞新鲜海鲜开始，在优雅的餐桌上款待宾客，烹制美味的海鲜料理，并调制清爽的果汁，让顾客满意而归。赚取利润，扩建您的餐厅，将您的小型码头打造成海滨豪华胜地。捕捞、烹饪，打造极致的海滨餐饮天堂！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\u003Ch3\u003E如何玩 Marina Club Rush？\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\n使用 WASD 键、方向键或操纵杆进行移动。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\u003Ch3\u003EMarina Club Rush是谁创建的？\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\n\nMarina Club Rush 由 Xscape 开发。您还可以在以下平台畅玩他们的其他游戏： Poki (宝玩)： \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fpoki.com\u002Fzh\u002Fg\u002Fsweet-ball-sprint\"\u003ESweet Ball Sprint\u003C\u002Fa\u003E 和 \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fpoki.com\u002Fzh\u002Fg\u002Fcapitalist-bus-driver\"\u003ECapitalist Bus Driver\u003C\u002Fa\u003E！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Ch3\u003E如何免费玩 Marina Club Rush？\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E您可以在 Poki 上免费玩 Marina Club Rush。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\u003Ch3\u003E我可以在手机和电脑上玩 Marina Club Rush 吗？\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\nMarina Club Rush 可以在电脑和移动设备（如手机和平板电脑）上玩。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","meta":{"site_id":73,"title":"MARINA CLUB RUSH - 免费在线玩! | Poki (宝玩)","description":"在最受欢迎的免费在线小游戏网站上玩Marina Club Rush！Poki (宝玩)可在您的手机、平板电脑或