q=50,width=94,height=94,fit=cover,f=auto/2e23801d55e26740cda57e6b2977234e/marina-club-rush-logo.png" srcSet="https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=94,height=94,fit=cover,f=auto/2e23801d55e26740cda57e6b2977234e/marina-club-rush-logo.png 1x, https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=188,height=188,fit=cover,f=auto/2e23801d55e26740cda57e6b2977234e/marina-club-rush-logo.png 2x" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high" width="94" height="94" class="ZkjjJvdHN77mDHPbAqAe" /></picture><figcaption class="pkyQYZUaPcJ5T7YkBgYe"><nav class="kd9Is9cTBZ_vuww2pWiX"><div class="wpZ3GoxLQVMZwH0a4VbJ"><div class="ywoqqyUKAOhwkYT8pgAd"><a href="/zh">游戏</a></div></div></nav><h1 class="TIakIJk_seZmjAw2Dhmw">Marina Club Rush</h1><div class="JMcreCZt8qSHW4ejT2vM"><span>制作方: </span>Xscape</div></figcaption></figure><div class="tFZVF03PQZaPOzLciiSJ"><div><p>
《Marina Club Rush》是一款码头经营模拟游戏，您将在这里建造并发展一家时尚的海滨俱乐部！从捕捞新鲜海鲜开始，在优雅的餐桌上款待宾客，烹制美味的海鲜料理，并调制清爽的果汁，让顾客满意而归。赚取利润，扩建您的餐厅，将您的小型码头打造成海滨豪华胜地。捕捞、烹饪，打造极致的海滨餐饮天堂！</p></div><button type="button" class="buttonReset m82lRUpJLGRrwux8_eBE">查看更多<span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-plus" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-plus.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye"></span></button></div></div><div class="aYbRzQy1dkv5k0ahUrTx"><p>
《Marina Club Rush》是一款码头经营模拟游戏，您将在这里建造并发展一家时尚的海滨俱乐部！从捕捞新鲜海鲜开始，在优雅的餐桌上款待宾客，烹制美味的海鲜料理，并调制清爽的果汁，让顾客满意而归。赚取利润，扩建您的餐厅，将您的小型码头打造成海滨豪华胜地。捕捞、烹饪，打造极致的海滨餐饮天堂！</p>

<h3>如何玩 Marina Club Rush？</h3>
<p>
使用 WASD 键、方向键或操纵杆进行移动。</p>

<h3>Marina Club Rush是谁创建的？</h3>
<p>

Marina Club Rush 由 Xscape 开发。您还可以在以下平台畅玩他们的其他游戏： Poki (宝玩)： <a onclick="window.navigateTo('/zh/g/sweet-ball-sprint');return false;" href="https://poki.com/zh/g/sweet-ball-sprint">Sweet Ball Sprint</a> 和 <a onclick="window.navigateTo('/zh/g/capitalist-bus-driver');return false;" href="https://poki.com/zh/g/capitalist-bus-driver">Capitalist Bus Driver</a>！</p>



<h3>如何免费玩 Marina Club Rush？</h3>
<p>您可以在 Poki 上免费玩 Marina Club Rush。</p>

<h3>我可以在手机和电脑上玩 Marina Club Rush 吗？</h3>
<p>
Marina Club Rush 可以在电脑和移动设备（如手机和平板电脑）上玩。</p></div></div><div class="gnTU2EC40IjqezF8mtia L2_WH8qwnlLKoltC4VDR"><ul class="Z7DT_mB2R6VWvdLiCfMW"><li class="kGgaXgO0yXnelvq8Y3Hw R0z1YfwIRDgkk8baNsbd"><div class="L1TFlm6IkmY7qyb5HRjp"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-star-filled" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-star-filled.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye zKViGp56WRLVtF8ND6Xd"></span></div><div class="roMzUgDy9WIDLLdpqCZg">评分</div><div class="Bp3YqeHZTp31GR5MQtEN">4.3</div></li><li class="kGgaXgO0yXnelvq8Y3Hw xz9cXwTfzZBFchgcbAjv"><div class="L1TFlm6IkmY7qyb5HRjp"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-fire" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-fire.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye zKViGp56WRLVtF8ND6Xd"></span></div><div class="roMzUgDy9WIDLLdpqCZg">热门</div><div class="Bp3YqeHZTp31GR5MQtEN">#8</div></li><li class="kGgaXgO0yXnelvq8Y3Hw AkAOzOFTQDUloHVayVJM"><div class="L1TFlm6IkmY7qyb5HRjp"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-lightning" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-lightning.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye zKViGp56WRLVtF8ND6Xd"></span></div><div class="roMzUgDy9WIDLLdpqCZg">已更新</div><div class="Bp3YqeHZTp31GR5MQtEN">2026年4月</div></li></ul></div><div class="gnTU2EC40IjqezF8mtia kTngT1jPeeDVW_iVpBY3"><h2 class="mksXb8gjVNuyAlN4LgAP">关于此游戏</h2><ul class="ls7Q57iVJt400u5jthXr"><li class="S6UxDoNzkX4ZuUx7qmPq"><span class="_y5H6xC7p0G7OeZu54TP"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-device-scanning" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-device-scanning.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye ZfPBC5hXIpQLefXgh1Ap"></span><span class="XJ8BFNhAzfgqNHfNKsJp">支持的设备</span></span><div class="OnH32zdME8mMTJvgJkfm">电脑, 手机和平板</div></li><li class="S6UxDoNzkX4ZuUx7qmPq"><span class="_y5H6xC7p0G7OeZu54TP"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-code" 